Legacy leftover from the original ported campaign: this is the stock BioWare plot-wizard template quest 'Assassination (no proof required)', with placeholder [Villain]/[Plot Giver] text. It is NOT a Bill Ferny quest despite having sat next to them under the same group.

Dead code as of 2026-07-18: its two blueprints (nw_innkeeper023 / ct_PlotGiver_AsnNP and nw_bandit030 / ct_Villain_AsnNP) are placed in no area and no encounter pool, so the only AddJournalQuestEntry("p000") call (p000c001ondeath.nss, the villain OnDeath) can never fire. Hidden from the wiki rather than deleted so it stays reversible. The live Bree Ferny plot is the custom "Ferny's Ring" -> "ferny_return" chain.

